    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flooded Burials is a top-down action adventure game about exploring a tower sunken in the sea. Play trough stages where you have to face combat and platforming challenges, as well as meet and talk to strange creatures. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful world for you to explore and uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep combat system with unique parrying mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique npc's you can talk to and get to know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple stages that can be replayed for higher ranks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you be able to lower the sea and uncover this words mysteries?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flooded Burials is a top-down action adventure game about exploring a tower sunken in the sea. Play trough stages where you have to face combat and platforming challenges, as well as meet and talk to strange creatures. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beautiful world for you to explore and uncover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deep combat system with unique parrying mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique npc's you can talk to and get to know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple stages that can be replayed for higher ranks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you be able to lower the sea and uncover this words mysteries?</p>",
    "short_description": "Flooded Burials is an adventure game about exploring a sunken tower. Lower the water levels by completing stages, and find out what lays at the bottom of this strange structure as you explore further down it's depths.",
